# Google OAuth 2.0 Credentials
# 1. Create a project at https://console.cloud.google.com/
# 2. Configure OAuth Consent Screen: Add app name (Jarvis AI Academy) and support email.
# 3. Create Credentials -> OAuth Client ID (Web Application)
# 4. Authorized JavaScript origins:
#    - https://jarvisaiacademy.netlify.app
#    - http://localhost:3000
#    - http://localhost:3003
# 5. Authorized redirect URIs:
#    - https://jarvisaiacademy.netlify.app/api/auth/google/callback
#    - http://localhost:3000/api/auth/google/callback
#    - http://localhost:3003/api/auth/google/callback
# 6. Copy Client ID and Client Secret below and paste in Netlify Environment Variables:

NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
